      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GENESIS BALE (4) goes very well this course and distance starting 12 times for four wins and three minors. In the money last time at this track (22.19) in a Grade 5, finishing a 1.3 lengths third. Has the ability and should feature. LEKTRA DAMIAN (1) made light work of a wide draw last time with a slick early sectional but gathered in and had to settle for the minors, finishing third (22.39) at this track over 390m. The form out of his last race has been franked. Can feature again. SHAKER STICKER (2) hasn't been far away here at the last two, finding the frame both times, most recently when second beaten a nose (22.40). Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Likely to be in the finish again. HOW AWESOME (8) pinged the lids and wasn't headed last time. Will be thereabouts.",
